        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, limestone</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, limestone
Data are estimated from air-picture. The mine has an annual yield of about 380'000 t;
Synonyms: quarry, Steinbruch; 
UUID: 187a7041-7467-3c10-bb86-6840e4b152f7
Includes the "land-use" of the built part of the mine and therefore the production places and the paved roads
Location: data are from only one company in Switzerland (KFN), for some exchanges RER-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: Medium size Swiss limestone mine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: survey 
Extrapolations: data which are only available for RER have been used as proxy for CH
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_187a7041-7467-3c10-bb86-6840e4b152f7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
